NOT DONE, DELIBERATELY
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
No menu entry was added for /admin/billing-groups. The read gate is
view_portfolio and the write gate is manage_billing, so any single menu gate is
wrong for someone — manage_billing hides it from legitimate read-only viewers,
view_portfolio shows an admin screen to the `member` role. fee31's custody-import
screen has no menu entry either, so this follows precedent rather than making a
menu-visibility call that belongs in its own decision. The page is reachable by
URL and fully gated server-side.

Out of scope and untouched, as instructed: fee_schedules, fee_assignments, any
fee computation, anything Altruist-API-shaped. Nothing derives billing groups
from households automatically.

